│  tray  ││  garage · August  │                                                 
│        ╭───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮──────────
│        │  tray is a task manager in two layers. Dump any task,     │         │
│     tas│  or a half-thought, into the garage for the month you     │         │
│  ▸  Rot│  expect to pick it up. Take it onto the tray when ready.  │         │
│     Cha│  ╭─ garage ────────────╮       ╭─ tray ──────────────╮    │         │
│     Boo│  │ anything, any month │  ────▶│ what you do now     │    │         │
│     Rev│  │ no structure asked  │  ◀────│ priority, due, tags │    │         │
│        │  ╰─────────────────────╯       ╰─────────────────────╯    │         │
│        │  (a)dd    a line to the layer you are on                  │         │
│        │  (t)ake   a garage line onto the tray, structured         │         │
│        │  (d)      hand a tray task back to the garage             │         │
│        │  (enter)  act on the selection; the menu lists the rest   │         │
│        │  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │         │
